.TH "RAPTOR-OPTIMISE" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-optimise \- Simulate the analytic spare\-stock path with common random numbers and recommend the cheapest point whose lower confidence bound meets the target. The model file is only changed when the apply flag is given.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor optimise\fR [\-h] WHAT ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Simulate the analytic spare\-stock path with common random numbers and recommend the cheapest point whose lower confidence bound meets the target. The model file is only changed when the apply flag is given.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
